UID:5104246@westlinnhs.wlwv.k12.or.us
DTSTAMP:20260901T043714Z
DTSTART:20260819T170000
DTEND:20260819T180000
SUMMARY:FEC Back To School Resource Event
DESCRIPTION:\nThe Family Empowerment Center will host the annual back-to-school resource event for the 2026-27 school year. Students from all schools in the West Linn-Wilsonville School District are welcome to take part.\n
LOCATION:Boeckman Creek Primary School (Back Playground Entrance)
CATEGORIES:School Events,School Events
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5093393@westlinnhs.wlwv.k12.or.us
DTSTAMP:20260901T043714Z
DTSTART:20260824T090000
DTEND:20260824T120000
SUMMARY:Lion Ambassador Training
DESCRIPTION:\nLion Ambassador Training takes place today in various locations across the school.  Lion Ambassadors should see Ms. Karmakar with questions.\n
CATEGORIES:School Events
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5104206@westlinnhs.wlwv.k12.or.us
DTSTAMP:20260901T043714Z
DTSTART:20260824T090000
DTEND:20260824T140000
SUMMARY:New Student Registration/Scheduling
DESCRIPTION:\nThis drop-in event for New Students is an opportunity to meet with a counselor to create your schedule for the 2026-2027 School Year.  If you are not yet registered\, please do so ahead of time\;  https://www.wlwv.k12.or.us/registration \n    \nCurrent students can meet with their counselors on another day\; this event is for New Students only.\n    \nThis event will take place in the Counseling Office\; please come to Student Street and follow the signs/instructions.\n
CATEGORIES:School Events
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
