DTSTAMP:20260901T043714Z
DTSTART:20260825T130000
DTEND:20260825T150000
SUMMARY:Schedule Changes-See Counselor-Juniors and Seniors
DESCRIPTION:\nIf your Schedule says "See Counselor" or you have a "hole" in your schedule\, such as a missing class\, come to the Counseling Office between 1-3pm\; no appointment is needed.  This event is for Juniors and Seniors ONLY\n
CATEGORIES:School Events
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
