UID:5114822@westlinnhs.wlwv.k12.or.us
DTSTAMP:20260901T043714Z
DTSTART:20260827T133000
DTEND:20260827T153000
SUMMARY:Smart Start
DESCRIPTION:Smart Start     \nSmart Start is an opportunity for students with 504s and IEPs\, and their parent-guardians\, to meet their teachers and prepare for the start of the school year. \n    \nSmart Start is scheduled for  THURSDAY\, AUG. 27  for the 2026-27 school year.\n       	* Smart Start is from  1:30 - 3:30 p.m.  for all  high schools (drop-in) . \n       \nTo help better know your students\, please complete the appropriate one-page profile found below. To assist in your family’s preparation for the new school year\, please see the Smart Start checklist posted below this message for parents and guardians of students with 504s and IEPs. We can't wait to meet your student!\n     Smart Start Student Profiles and Checklist        	*  Checklist \n  	*  Primary one page profile \n  	*  Secondary one page profile \n
CATEGORIES:School Events
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
