BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5093394@westlinnhs.wlwv.k12.or.us
DTSTAMP:20260901T043714Z
DTSTART:20260828T090000
DTEND:20260828T120000
SUMMARY:9th Grade Student Orientation
DESCRIPTION:\nIncoming 9th graders\, please join us for Orientation today.  You will meet your Lion Ambassador\, take a tour of the school\, learn about activities and supports offered across the school\, and meet your ASB Leaders. \n    \nThis event is for rising 9th graders only--please\, no parents or siblings.\n
CATEGORIES:School Events
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5093390@westlinnhs.wlwv.k12.or.us
DTSTAMP:20260901T043714Z
DTSTART:20260831T080000
DTEND:20260831T140000
SUMMARY:School Pictures
DESCRIPTION:\nPlease join us in the Main Gym for school pictures.  Ordering information will be released in due course.\n
CATEGORIES:School Events
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
