SUMMARY:Club Faire
DESCRIPTION:\nClub Faire will be held today in the Main Gym.  Students will be released by Grade Level during Life Class to sign up to join WLHS Clubs.  You can find the complete directory of Clubs  https://westlinnhs.wlwv.k12.or.us/for-students/clubs \n
