DTSTART:20260923T180000
DTEND:20260923T203000
SUMMARY:Curriculum Night
DESCRIPTION:\nPlease join us for Curriculum Night.  Parents and Guardians of 9th grade students should meet in the Performing Arts Center at 6pm\; parents and guardians of students in grades 10-12 should meet in the PAC at 6:30pm.  You will hear from Administrators\, Counselors\, and have an opportunity to visit your students' classrooms and meet their teachers. \n
CATEGORIES:School Events
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
